    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE NAVY BEARS!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us by adding to your wishlist and stay notified about all updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCORD CHANNEL:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel to stay updated or share your thoughts on the game!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong>BEAR</strong>, a veteran of the elite <strong>NAVY BEARS</strong> unit in <strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong> \u2013 a 2.5D action-adventure game in which you will face the evil <i>Professor Rat</i> and his army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE HERO, ONE MISSION: SAVE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1733204439\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You once again step into the front lines to defeat the plans of <i>Professor Rat</i>. You are the only one who can achieve this goal - you're not just a soldier, you are the last line of defense against the impending chaos - you're the <strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1733204439\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dynamic environments, adapting your approach as you navigate the storyline. Some missions demand a silent touch, requiring you to slip through the shadows unnoticed. Others call for a more explosive resolution, involving the all of your <strong>BEAR</strong>-sized arsenal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER EVERY STEP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.poster.avif?t=1733204439\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.webm?t=1733204439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.mp4?t=1733204439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with precision\u2014whether it's wall jumping, swinging across ropes, or leaping over pits. Every move matters in your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1733204439\" width=640 height=250 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong> blends storytelling with action, inviting you to uncover the mysteries behind <i>Professor Rat</i> sinister plot. The world\u2019s fate is in your hands. Are you ready to face every challenge and become the hero we need?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong>BEAR</strong>, a veteran of the elite <strong>NAVY BEARS</strong> unit in <strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong> \u2013 a 2.5D action-adventure game in which you will face the evil <i>Professor Rat</i> and his army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE HERO, ONE MISSION: SAVE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1733204439\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You once again step into the front lines to defeat the plans of <i>Professor Rat</i>. You are the only one who can achieve this goal - you're not just a soldier, you are the last line of defense against the impending chaos - you're the <strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1733204439\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dynamic environments, adapting your approach as you navigate the storyline. Some missions demand a silent touch, requiring you to slip through the shadows unnoticed. Others call for a more explosive resolution, involving the all of your <strong>BEAR</strong>-sized arsenal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER EVERY STEP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.poster.avif?t=1733204439\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.webm?t=1733204439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/ad61dab1073971b66e48c55bc63aaff5.mp4?t=1733204439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with precision\u2014whether it's wall jumping, swinging across ropes, or leaping over pits. Every move matters in your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646480/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1733204439\" width=640 height=250 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE BEAR ARMY</strong> blends storytelling with action, inviting you to uncover the mysteries behind <i>Professor Rat</i> sinister plot. The world\u2019s fate is in your hands. Are you ready to face every challenge and become the hero we need?</p>",
